For instance, let's refer to

98
00:03:44,090 --> 00:03:45,905
the example of overstocked plants

99
00:03:45,905 --> 00:03:47,600
from the previous video.

100
00:03:47,600 --> 00:03:51,720
Well, using PDCA—plan,
do, check, act—you

101
00:03:51,721 --> 00:03:53,660
notice a drop in

102
00:03:53,660 --> 00:03:55,810
the sales of one of
the plant varieties.

103
00:03:55,810 --> 00:03:58,340
So you decide to
