This is, in fact, a new process.

112
00:04:14,990 --> 00:04:16,430
Running it over and over again

113
00:04:16,430 --> 00:04:19,205
will drive continuous
improvements.

114
00:04:19,205 --> 00:04:22,100
The continuous
improvement you made to

115
00:04:22,100 --> 00:04:25,384
the project reflected well in
your program and portfolio,

116
00:04:25,384 --> 00:04:27,500
because now that
that it's been tested,

